(TEMPORARY DIAGNOSTIC 2026-08-12 -- delete when the spindle question is closed.)
(Reproduces ONLY the spindle line out of rotary_face: a named parameter fed)
(to S inside a subroutine. No axis moves at all.)
o<spin_test> sub
  #<rpm> = #1 (=1200 rpm)
  o1 if [#<rpm> LE 0]
    #<rpm> = 1200
  o1 endif
  #<sout> = #<rpm>
  (PRINT, SPIN TEST: about to command M3 S#<sout>)
  M3 S#<sout>
  G4 P3
  M5
  (PRINT, SPIN TEST: done)
o<spin_test> endsub
M2 (end program)
